          "audio": "A single upbeat, high-pitched electronic pop sound effect triggers as the screen appears.",
          "label": "Product Information",
          "visual": "A static digital interface on a clean, light gray background shows a 'Customize your dot' menu. The screen is divided into two main sections: a left-side customization panel and a right-side preview card. The interface uses soft shadows and rounded corners with a bright, minimalist aesthetic. The lighting is uniform, resembling a backlit digital display.",
